<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Jan-May rubber output up 3.5 pct on yr.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Jan-May rubber output up 3.5 pct on yr.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lankan rubber production rose 3.5 percent year-on-year to 50.3 million kg in the first five months of the year, the Central Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Output in the January to May period in 1996 was 48.6 million kg, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
